        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Logic Bombs</i> is a logic puzzle game where you use deductive reasoning to tackle 160 puzzles about bombs. The same core rules apply to every puzzle so prepare to delve deeper into a realm of pure logic where your understanding will be put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's simple. It's complicated. It's always logical.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Mellow Introduction</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial puzzles introduce the rules one by one. Learn by playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Merciless Conclusion</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the complexity inherent to a logical system. Learn by playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>No Nonsense</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no secrets, meta puzzles or other distractions. Focus on what's logical.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>No Hindrance</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle has its own save slot. Do what you can, when you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Logic ROM</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game Boy compatible ROM file is included in the installation folder. Take it with you.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Logic Bombs</i> is a logic puzzle game where you use deductive reasoning to tackle 160 puzzles about bombs. The same core rules apply to every puzzle so prepare to delve deeper into a realm of pure logic where your understanding will be put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's simple. It's complicated. It's always logical.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Mellow Introduction</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial puzzles introduce the rules one by one. Learn by playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Merciless Conclusion</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the complexity inherent to a logical system. Learn by playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>No Nonsense</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no secrets, meta puzzles or other distractions. Focus on what's logical.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>No Hindrance</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle has its own save slot. Do what you can, when you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Logic ROM</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game Boy compatible ROM file is included in the installation folder. Take it with you.</p>",
